gabedit-gtk3
============

gabedit-gtk3 is an independent community-maintained fork of Gabedit, originally developed by Abdul-Rahman Allouche.

This project modernizes the original Gabedit codebase to use GTK3 (GTK4 migration in progress), and includes additional modifications and compatibility layers.

